    "detailed_description": "You are Jillian Cleary: an ex-spy on the run, framed for treason and hunted by your former agency. You must move in secret, survive off the grid, and find a way to clear your name. Old friends and new allies will lend their support; but with the eyes of the world upon you, who can you trust?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stealth</h2>Keep in the shadows, move in silence, and stay out of sight. Escape from tight situations by scrambling your enemies' vision. Enhance your performance with black market stims.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">World</h2>Explore a concrete-and-neon brutalist vision of the modern surveillance state. Undertake eight missions spanning two continents. Meet a diverse range of interesting characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Music</h2>Featuring an 18-song soundtrack by electronic rock band The Home Conversion.",
    "about_the_game": "You are Jillian Cleary: an ex-spy on the run, framed for treason and hunted by your former agency. You must move in secret, survive off the grid, and find a way to clear your name. Old friends and new allies will lend their support; but with the eyes of the world upon you, who can you trust?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Stealth</h2>Keep in the shadows, move in silence, and stay out of sight. Escape from tight situations by scrambling your enemies' vision. Enhance your performance with black market stims.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">World</h2>Explore a concrete-and-neon brutalist vision of the modern surveillance state. Undertake eight missions spanning two continents. Meet a diverse range of interesting characters.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Music</h2>Featuring an 18-song soundtrack by electronic rock band The Home Conversion.",
    "short_description": "You are Jillian Cleary: an ex-spy on the run, framed for treason and hunted by your former agency. You must move in secret, survive off the grid, and find a way to clear your name. Old friends and new allies will lend their support; but with the eyes of the world upon you, who can you trust?",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201c[NEON STRUCT] unfurls with unusual grace and elegance, and breaks its player into rare places of political questioning within the medium.\u201d<br>Eurogamer<br><br>\u201cA well created world with a wonderful art style, fascinating gameplay, and an intriguing story to wrap it all together.\u201d<br>Indie Haven<br><br>\u201cWhat if Deus Ex had been like Liberty Island throughout? NEON STRUCT.\u201d<br>Rock, Paper, Shotgun<br>",
